    "body": "Related to #43501. Follow-up to [@mgoin's request](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/43501#issuecomment-5716717828) to roll out manual fusion in model batches.\n\nRoute Qwen2MoeMLP through the existing manual activation/quantization fusion. This covers Qwen1.5-MoE, Qwen2-MoE and the reused Qwen3Next MLP, including shared experts. The shared-expert gate still uses the original input.\n\nNative FP8 engagement needs #57514's consumer-key exposure. No kernel or consumer changes are included here.\n\n## Tests\n\n1× H100 80GB, TP1, with nightly binaries:\n\n- Shared-expert FP8 regression: passes with the change, fails without it.\n- Qwen2-57B-A14B FP8 with #57514: fusion runs in all 28 shared MLPs. With #59514 too, sampled GSM8K scored 204/256 → 207/256; compiled throughput rose 0.9–1.8% (three runs). Without #59514, throughput was unchanged.\n",
    "changed_files": 2,
